            "detailed_description": "Sun Dogs is about <strong>exploring our inner solar system, altering your body, and embracing death.</strong> <br><br>In a future where <strong>humanity alters itself</strong> without a second thought, you must do the same. <br>Skim along the Sun's corona, <strong>float in the Venusian clouds</strong>, travel the Martian plains.<br><strong>When your body dies</strong>, your mind will be given a new one, and you will keep going.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Expansive and unique science fiction, across planets, moons, and space stations<br></li><li>Dynamic text reacts to your character and actions <br></li><li>Full modding system allowing additions or rewrites to the entire game</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Sun Dogs is about <strong>exploring our inner solar system, altering your body, and embracing death.</strong> <br><br>In a future where <strong>humanity alters itself</strong> without a second thought, you must do the same. <br>Skim along the Sun's corona, <strong>float in the Venusian clouds</strong>, travel the Martian plains.<br><strong>When your body dies</strong>, your mind will be given a new one, and you will keep going.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Expansive and unique science fiction, across planets, moons, and space stations<br></li><li>Dynamic text reacts to your character and actions <br></li><li>Full modding system allowing additions or rewrites to the entire game</li></ul>",
